[{"id":"ultimate_wilderness:class_feature:barbarian_archetype_cave_dweller","label":"Cave Dweller","value":"Text","prose":[{"family":"Desc","pieces":[{"Text":"Unused to the light of the sun, cave dwellers use their subterranean expertise to protect their clans from the manifold dangers of deep caverns and tunnels. The typical cave dweller is perfectly content to live his entire life underground, and he may even view the light of the sun as particularly abhorrent or taboo. While this lifestyle doesn't in and of itself imply evil or sinister intent, many outlanders ignorantly assume that cave dwellers avoid the light of the sun for malicious reasons. In truth, cave dwellers are as capable of goodness and kindness as any other-they just see little reason to venture out of their preferred homelands. When a cave dweller joins an adventuring party, she may retain an inherent nervousness about sleeping under the open sky and may long for the familiar confines of a comforting cavern, but this rarely translates directly into a notable disadvantage."}],"pick_last":false,"suppress_when_all_zero":false}],"applies":{"All":[{"Compare":{"lhs":{"ClassLevel":"barbarian"},"op":"Gte","rhs":{"Const":1}}},{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"ultimate_wilderness:class_feature:barbarian_archetype_cave_dweller"},"count":1}},{"Not":{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"adventurers_guide:class_feature:barbarian_archetype_geminate_invoker"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"ultimate_wilderness:class_feature:barbarian_archetype_brutish_swamper"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"ultimate_wilderness:class_feature:barbarian_archetype_cave_dweller"},"count":1}}]}},{"AtLeast":{"n":1,"of":[{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_players_guide:class_feature:barbarian_archetype_breaker"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_players_guide:class_feature:barbarian_archetype_breaker"},"count":1}},{"Holds":{"what":{"Rule":"advanced_players_guid